			<div class="row justify-content-center gy-4">
									<div class="wysiwyg col-md-6">
						<h2>Welcome to Borderless Hematology.</h2>
<p>EHA is the leading force in hematology, bringing the community together to share knowledge, collaborate, connect, and grow.</p>
<p>Together we accelerate progress through education, science, and innovation. Together we improve patient outcomes and progress towards cures—across Europe and beyond.</p>
<p>Together, the future of hematology is within our reach.</p>
<p>Join us with <a href="https://ehaweb.org/connect-network/membership-and-benefits">membership that works for you</a> or <a href="https://ehaweb.org/about-eha/mission-and-vision">learn more about our story</a>.</p>

					</div>
