        </h2>

        <div class="mb-6 mb-lg-16 wysiwyg">
          <h2>Become a mentor today</h2>
<p>Mentoring is about more than sharing knowledge. It&#8217;s about building connections, gaining fresh perspectives, and helping shape the future of hematology.</p>
<p>If you believe in the power of community and want to support the next generation of hematology professionals, we&#8217;d love to welcome you as an EHA Mentor.</p>

        </div>

        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 gap-lg-8">
          <a href="https://ehaweb.org/education-training/mentoring-and-career-development/eha-mentorship-program" class="btn btn-primary" target="">
